WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.360
Good morning, John. Let's talk about The Hunger Games. A story about action, and love,

00:00:04.360 --> 00:00:08.200
and a really, really screwed up society. There are some easy things to relate to, here.

00:00:08.200 --> 00:00:13.160
Most of can relate to love, a lot of people enjoy a good action sequence, and, yeah, we like to see

00:00:13.160 --> 00:00:19.920
the underdog rising up against the evil, oppressive regime! An unimaginably inequitable society

00:00:19.920 --> 00:00:26.100
in which people starve, while other people gorge themselves so much that they have to then go puke

00:00:26.100 --> 00:00:30.780
so that they can eat more. A world where a table is worth more than a human life.

00:00:30.780 --> 00:00:36.260
That's like the hardest thing to relate to out of the whole movie, except that it's not because we kind of live in that world.

00:00:36.260 --> 00:00:41.060
Suzanne Collins does an amazing job of this, of showing us, basically, a world that looks a lot like the world

00:00:41.060 --> 00:00:45.800
that we live in, and having us look at it and say, "how could anyone live in a world like that?"

00:00:45.800 --> 00:00:50.400
She also does a really admirable job of not blaming the participants of that society.

00:00:50.400 --> 00:00:54.920
Like, Katniss and Effie are friends, they love each other. Katniss is her friend despite the fact that Effie has

00:00:54.920 --> 00:00:59.220
always been, and continues to be, a participant in that culture of oppression. Why is that?

00:00:59.220 --> 00:01:03.640
Well, it's because Effie isn't evil. There's one thing that exists in abundance in the Hunger Games, though,

00:01:03.640 --> 00:01:09.080
that does not exist so much in our world. As nice as it would be if this weren't true, and impossible as it

00:01:09.080 --> 00:01:16.140
kind of is to believe, our deeply unequal society is not the result of a bunch of bad guys.

00:01:16.140 --> 00:01:20.980
We don't have a President Snow. Or, we do have a President Snow, but he's not a person.

00:01:20.980 --> 00:01:25.820
The thing that causes inequality isn't some corrupt politician, it's not a bunch of psychopathic CEOs.

00:01:25.820 --> 00:01:31.520
Inequality is caused by human nature, psychology, sociology, and... math. It's caused by math!

00:01:31.520 --> 00:01:37.580
And you can't fight math! It's math! Let's take a example: two people. One of them is rich, one of them is

00:01:37.580 --> 00:01:42.760
middle-class. They both want to invest in Netflix, a year ago. The middle class person invests $10,000,

00:01:42.760 --> 00:01:48.440
the rich person invests $1,000,000. Both of their money doubles in the next 12 months.

00:01:48.440 --> 00:01:53.500
That's a tremendous success for both of them, except that the rich person has a 1,000,000 new dollars,

00:01:53.500 --> 00:01:59.000
and the middle-class person has 10,000 new dollars. Inequality is also created by greed. Yes.

00:01:59.000 --> 00:02:03.820
And it's created by societal structures, like rich people helping out rich people makes rich people much richer

00:02:03.820 --> 00:02:08.560
than poor people helping out poor people. And rich people hang out with rich people, and poor people

00:02:08.560 --> 00:02:12.880
hang out with poor people. That's a problem. It is not an easy problem to solve!

00:02:12.880 --> 00:02:18.700
I'd love to discuss all of the different cultural and psychological and sociological and mathematical

00:02:18.700 --> 00:02:23.140
reasons for inequality perpetuating itself, but I'm not making a documentary of film here. I just want to

00:02:23.140 --> 00:02:28.600
point out that inequality is not the result of animosity, it is just the result of the status quo.

00:02:28.600 --> 00:02:34.980
It's complacence that causes it, not evil. It's just the simplest path, like, I probably spent enough money on,

00:02:34.980 --> 00:02:41.560
like, fancy dinners with my wife this year, to save the lives of other people. But I didn't do that, I bought

00:02:41.560 --> 00:02:47.860
fancy dinners with my wife. Because that's what felt like the right thing to do, that's just the normal thing to do,

00:02:47.860 --> 00:02:53.660
that's the status quo, the complacent- the path of least resistance. That makes me President Snow.

00:02:53.660 --> 00:02:59.420
I'm not evil. But I am complacent in that system. And just like Katniss doesn't hate Effie, I don't hate myself for

00:02:59.420 --> 00:03:05.400
that. But I do recognize that because inequality is the path of least resistance, we have to have structures

00:03:05.400 --> 00:03:11.200
to fight against it. Because inequality isn't just bad for poor people, it's bad for the economy,

00:03:11.200 --> 00:03:16.680
and it's bad for people's happiness. There is a very strong correlation between the equality of a

00:03:16.680 --> 00:03:21.420
society and the happiness of the people in that society. Not just the happiness of the poor people, either,

00:03:21.420 --> 00:03:26.920
the rich people are happier too! So we have to fight it, we have to recalibrate for equality, and we can do that

00:03:26.920 --> 00:03:32.240
in a lot of different ways. We can do that by helping people ourselves, we can also do it by making the

00:03:32.240 --> 00:03:35.960
government do it. You can also start on that path by signing up for the Harry Potter Alliance's Odds in

00:03:35.960 --> 00:03:40.080
Our Favour campaign. A little bit of this. And it's also why you should be thinking about what you're gonna do

00:03:40.080 --> 00:03:43.520
for the Project for Awesome this year. And, if you're curious about how to make a great Project for Awesome

00:03:43.520 --> 00:03:47.460
video, I just made a video about that! And uploaded it on the Project for Awesome Youtube channel.

00:03:47.460 --> 00:03:52.140
Which you can go check out. You can learn how to make good videos promoting great charities.

00:03:52.140 --> 00:03:53.780
John, I'll see you on Tuesday.

00:03:53.780 --> 00:03:58.640
[Hank from P4A video:] The Project for Awesome is in just 10 days, which means that you need to buckle down and figure out what that mean-

